# Reconnaissance Partition: "This creature enters with two charge counters on it" and "{T}, Remove a counter from this
# creature: Choose one — • Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. •
# Draw a card." (CR 614.1c, 700.2, 701.23). Bot1 casts it on turn 1 and it enters with exactly two counters. On turn 3 it
# taps and removes one to fetch an Island, which arrives tapped and the pool it paid with is empty; on turn 5 it removes
# the last counter to draw a card. On turn 7 there is no counter to remove, so the ability is not offered.

